  "bodyHash": "d9f39457e1ce4b75",
  "content": "\n\n<blockquote><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>免責聲明：</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>+ </strong></em></span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\">此資源包<strong>需要</strong><strong>Doggy Talents Next&nbsp;</strong><strong>才能運作！</strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">你可以在這裡找到該模組：&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doggy-talents-next\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doggy-talents-next</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>+ NWxDTN <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>僅對安裝了此資源包的玩家可見</strong></span>。否則，它將會呈現為<strong>普通狼。</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>+ NWxDTN <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>相容</strong>於<strong>&nbsp;所有</strong>&nbsp;<strong>版本的 DTN</strong></span>，即使 Minecraft 提示此資源包「不相容」。</em></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><em>受夠了等待 DTN 和 DTNP 更新了嗎？</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>隆重推出...</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/DashieDev/DoggyTalentsNext/assets/122363761/31002f8d-bdef-4e34-87e0-a272e9f11644\" width=\"594\" height=\"505\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦴🐾 === New Wolves X Doggy Talents Next === 🐾🦴</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>你可以在任何已安裝 Doggy Talents Next 的伺服器上使用它！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組將<strong>所有</strong>&nbsp;<strong>狼變體</strong>（來自<strong>Minecraft 1.20.5 新狼、DTN 與 DTNP</strong>）新增為<strong>可選皮膚！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦴🐾 === 如何取得皮膚 === 🐾🦴</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1. 蹲下點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdoggytalentsnext.wiki.gg%252fwiki%252fGetting_Started\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>訓練過的狗</strong></a></strong>&nbsp;以開啟<strong>狗狗選單</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">2. 前往<strong>造型標籤頁 -&gt; 皮膚</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">3. 新加入的皮膚會位於列表最末端（你也可以使用標籤搜尋功能）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/DashieDev/DoggyTalentsNext/assets/122363761/54930a78-809b-4f2c-ae38-3b8e9f5ca3d6\" alt=\"Demo.gif\" width=\"729\" height=\"418\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>-------------🦴🐾看看其他作品！🦴🐾-------------</em></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dtns-palette-of-paws\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987189/description_e043a0ce-8350-4cc6-870b-bcda88fe26ff.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a>  &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doggy-talents-next\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1051461/description_7a64ee81-714a-4c3b-b62e-7639eb4640db.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a>  &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dtn-community-skin-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/694492/description_8a4bf69f-6bf6-4548-8600-8cf80637930b.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dtn-community-skin-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/694492/description_1be07a6a-255d-4595-b8c4-5da97eb95ba8.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></em></strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Doggy Talents Next 的 Palette Of Paws</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Doggy Talents Next</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>BetterDogs X DTN（客戶端）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Doggy Talents Next 的社群皮膚擴充套件（客戶端）</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>遇到問題嗎？<strong>請將所有問題與討論</strong>張貼至<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/DashieDev/DoggyTalentsNext/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a>&nbsp;或我們的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/VnSkMufZEc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>！</strong>這樣可以讓我們的工作輕鬆許多，也能讓大家保持一致！</p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VnSkMufZEc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/DashieDev/DoggyTalentsNext/assets/61554666/c9337b04-4f7f-4e72-b1fe-20629ed64e94\" alt=\"\" width=\"665\" height=\"168\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我們還開設了<strong>YouTube 頻道</strong>：<strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCzeU2yIAywORQGXC_WieD8w\" rel=\"nofollow\">【 狼才能次 】🦴 DoggyTalentsNextMod OFFICIAL 🦴</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><em>所有權利歸 Mojang Studios 所有。</em></p>",
